81" end="01:46.348">chance</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.348" end="01:49.392"><span begin="01:46.348" end="01:46.676">That </span><span begin="01:46.676" end="01:46.912">you'll </span><span begin="01:46.912" end="01:47.215">stay </span><span begin="01:47.215" end="01:47.519">through </span><span begin="01:47.519" end="01:47.872">the </span><span begin="01:47.872" end="01:49.392">night</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.791" end="01:57.863"><span begin="01:54.791" end="01:55.080">You </span><span begin="01:55.080" end="01:55.423">just </span><span begin="01:55.423" end="01:56.001">wanna </span><span begin="01:56.001" end="01:56.303">fill </span><span begin="01:56.303" end="01:56.634">the </span><span begin="01:56.634" end="01:57.169">void </span><span begin="01:57.169" end="01:57.863">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.408" end="02:03.215"><span begin="01:58.408" end="01:58.679">I </span><span begin="01:58.679" end="01:58.985">can </span><span begin="01:58.985" end="01:59.359">tell </span><span begin="01:59.359" end="01:59.584">that </span><span begin="01:59.584" end="01:59.839">you've </span><span begin="01:59.839" end="02:00.207">been </span><span begin="02:00.207" end="02:00.752">yelling </span><span begin="02:00.752" end="02:01.056">at </span><span begin="02:01.056" end="02:01.359">him </span><span begin="02:01.359" end="02:01.959">all </span><span begin="02:01.959" end="02:02.576">night </span><span begin="02:02.576" end="02:03.215">long</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.254" end="02:07.454"><span begin="02:04.254" end="02:04.454">And </span><span begin="02:04.454" end="02:04.694">I </span><span begin="02:04.694" end="02:04.998">can </span><span begin="02:04.998" end="02:05.278">hear </span><span begin="02:05.278" end="02:05.566">it </span><span begin="02:05.566" end="02:05.878">in </span><span begin="02:05.878" end="02:06.230">your </span><span begin="02:06.230" end="02:06.830">voice </span><span begin="02:06.830" end="02:07.45